    "text": "By Zach Fisher ,\n4 hours ago KANSAS CITY, Mo. (KCTV) - A driver struck and killed a 35-year-old construction worker near Waynesville Monday night. Investigators said the worker was flagging traffic when the driver struck him. The driver never saw him. It is the fifth work zone fatality in Missouri this year. Work zone deaths climb... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 3",
